#: b5b590eaa9574720bbc0f3511d97e327 cf61d7caba54470d94c979cff1858962
#: d6a17ed88ade40e9ad1ad73ce0f4389c e44e4560e3064b54adad2c5cf2f7abff
msgid ""
"First search the wiki to determine if there is already a wiki page about "
"your topic — it is better to improve an existing topic than create a near-"
"duplicate! Also discuss it with the `Wiki Editors on Discord "
"<https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ or enter an issue in the `Wiki issue list"
" <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/issues>`__."
msgstr ""
"首先搜索 wiki 确认是否已有关于您主题的页面——完善现有主题比创建近似重复内容更好！也可在 `Discord 的 Wiki 编辑频道 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ 讨论，或在 `Wiki issue 列表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/issues>`__ 提交 issue。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:23
#: 0e8bbbe31649475a9fb2a2059cab04c2 10c259db633b440da030e3a2af3a0031
#: 18045c208928440f983672ed14c5f6de 371c2072e5064a0badbab926af44598a
#: 5426277cef774542abd220f6911f91c2 983e139974044fe9b46d55aab90d5eb7
#: afeeb1a786934166acf0afa8d94fc555 b907d8835ef74f0d8e66eccb1555ef2e
#: d031275220d9472a8b6825fcef1f7917 dc3c2390cdd24050afd0540d7d80d508
#: ec2174efb9b94a0aba5e4f96374da9ac ec23b6d46ebd4dcfb40d0c588a74a261
msgid ""
"Pages should be created in the **/source/docs/** folder for your target "
"wiki, given a \"descriptive\" name, and the file suffix \".rst\". Typically "
"we use all lower case for filename, and separate words using \"-\" or \"_\"."
" For example: **advanced-multicopter-design.rst**."
msgstr ""
"页面应在目标 wiki 的 **/source/docs/** "
"文件夹中创建，使用「描述性」名称，文件后缀为「.rst」。通常文件名全小写，单词之间用「-」或「_」分隔。例如：**advanced-"
"multicopter-design.rst**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:27
#: 39366b1759bf457bb995ab090f66bb94 4a8500b2c4424baf8f97c8a2e532d5a1
#: 59bc56d65ada4af3bf77e1f3d273fdea 75a8d76202014ca2857231478b908a9c
#: a5deaec239d545dfa08299e98ccd8394 b9afc8f1614d4676a3b86da0c3b4d3c6
#: bdc20c3281fc4adb94645a1eb0b20d66 bf90d8c0b6c24cca9c33057de4536e57
#: d5f94c51a05f4a9d890e79e143fb9a60 d6d3f13f523647779a0acd543ae711fc
#: dbfaa76f6a394f478a6d12df86d84f92 e8d3ebaf9b7948d08dad13ca68e3be63
msgid ""
"Pages that are common to all wikis must be named with the prefix **common-**"
" and must be created in **/common/source/docs/**. See "
":ref:`common_wiki_editing_guide_common_pages` for more information."
msgstr ""
"所有 wiki 通用的页面必须以 **common-** 为前缀，并必须在 **/common/source/docs/** 中创建。更多信息参见 "
":ref:`common_wiki_editing_guide_common_pages`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:30
#: 4342d2b996d54443a40139b99646ed9b 4a17c544241346b6b264224d6ca991ba
#: 51f3819ef12545e8b8f832de7fd4f8ac 5d90dc1fe96d4e4a9e4379b7ee8d681b
#: 5ebab18efd8f4660828ced438cb24946 61cdf1aef6f84b499ab005dd6399f8f8
#: 7ad3dc559e86498a9463a06c369768b3 927f9c285b994deea3c4877e218d84c0
#: ad3fc4fb6f64487daa210177a732493c ba4c1bea4fac47c0948ac93d8e6eccd0
#: d341ec7bfb164332974927894ed8cbcc d9166db3a1ab43998710ffc6a5dc2cf5
msgid ""
"The title of the new page should be concise — informative enough that the "
"reader can determine whether the topic is relevant and to differentiate it "
"from other similar topics. The first letter of every word in the heading "
"should be capitalized, with the exception of short connecting words like "
"\"a\", \"with\", \"and\", \"the\"."
msgstr ""
"新页面的标题应简洁——信息量足以让读者判断主题是否相关，并与其他类似主题区分。标题中每个单词的首字母应大写，但「a」、「with」、「and」、「the」等短连接词除外。"

