#: e3b0908d763446bf848a27075b9e58d1 f6dfdaf5534346f598480da1147dedb4
msgid ""
"Vehicle-specific content can be added to the common topic using the ``site``"
" shortcode. Text that is not applicable to a target wiki is stripped out "
"before the common page is copied to each wiki. The example below shows text "
"that will only appear on rover and plane wikis (use site rather than xsite "
"shown below!)"
msgstr ""
"可使用 ``site`` shortcode 向通用主题添加特定飞行器的内容。不适用于目标 wiki 的文本在复制到各 wiki "
"前会被删除。以下示例显示仅出现在 rover 和 plane wiki 的文本（使用 site 而非下面显示的 xsite！）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:79
#: 041c6f968db8462695884dd31f04468d 06ff8970eb2f466fbfdaa7f28402c539
#: 0d468cc90b38432388f0fa925974ff63 284e86f088534d2ebb97b0f6a9853dfb
