"Always :ref:`link to other common topics <common-editor-information-"
"resource_how_to_link_to_other_topics>` using relative linking. This ensures "
"that you will link to the correct common topic when the wiki article is "
"copied."
msgstr ""
"始终使用相对链接 :ref:`链接到其他通用主题 <common-editor-information-"
"resource_how_to_link_to_other_topics>`。这确保 wiki 文章被复制时链接到正确的通用主题。"

